{
  "id": "E396",
  "title": "Can’t Sleep?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-01-25",
  "synopsis": "Do you have any good solutions for insomnia? Lili has a suggestion.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50396/8697905274cf430eb0836aaa0b1ecd39f5774a26.mp3?1579527522",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "睡不着怎么办？\n\n丽丽：你的眼睛红红的，怎么了？\n本：昨天晚上我没睡。\n丽丽：我不是告诉你了吗？睡不着的时候，看看你最不喜欢的书。看一会儿就睡着了。\n本：我就是这么做的，我看一会儿数学书就能睡着。\n丽丽：那你怎么还是没睡好？\n本：我看了几分钟，突然想到明天就是数学考试了，所以我看了一晚上数学，做了一晚上数学题。\n",
    "traditional": "睡不著怎麼辦？\n\n麗麗：你的眼睛紅紅的，怎麼了？\n本：昨天晚上我沒睡。\n麗麗：我不是告訴你了嗎？睡不著的時候，看看你最不喜歡的書。看一會兒就睡著了。\n本：我就是這麼做的，我看一會兒數學書就能睡著。\n麗麗：那你怎麼還是沒睡好？\n本：我看了幾分鐘，突然想到明天就是數學考試了，所以我看了一晚上數學，做了一晚上數學題。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What to do when you can’t sleep?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你的眼睛红红的，怎么了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你的眼睛紅紅的，怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ de yǎn jing hóng hóng de zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Your eyes are red, what happened?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：昨天晚上我没睡。",
      "traditional": "本：昨天晚上我沒睡。",
      "pinyin": "běn zuó tiān wǎn shang wǒ méi shuì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I didn’t sleep last night."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我不是告诉你了吗？睡不着的时候，看看你最不喜欢的书。看一会儿就睡着了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我不是告訴你了嗎？睡不著的時候，看看你最不喜歡的書。看一會兒就睡著了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ bú shì gào su nǐ le ma shuì bù zháo de shí hou kàn kan nǐ zuì bù xǐ huan de shū kàn yí huì'r jiù shuì zháo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Haven’t I told you? When you can’t sleep, read your least favorite book. You’ll fall asleep in an instant."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：我就是这么做的，我看一会儿数学书就能睡着。",
      "traditional": "本：我就是這麼做的，我看一會兒數學書就能睡著。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ jiù shì zhè me zuò de wǒ kàn yí huì'r shù xué shū jiù néng shuì zháo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That’s exactly what I did. I can fall asleep after reading a maths book for a while."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那你怎么还是没睡好？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那你怎麼還是沒睡好？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà nǐ zěn me hái shì méi shuì hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Then how did you still not fall sleep?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：我看了几分钟，突然想到明天就是数学考试了，",
      "traditional": "本：我看了幾分鐘，突然想到明天就是數學考試了，",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ kàn le jǐ fēn zhōng tū rán xiǎng dào míng tiān jiù shì shù xué kǎo shì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "所以我看了一晚上数学，做了一晚上数学题。",
      "traditional": "所以我看了一晚上數學，做了一晚上數學題。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ wǒ kàn le yì wǎn shang shù xué zuò le yì wǎn shang shù xué tí",
      "english": "Ben: I read for a few minutes, and suddenly realized that there is a math exam tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So I read math books and did math questions the whole night."
    }
  ],
